<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106081" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύφω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			4.196
		</span></i>, etc.: aor.inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῦψαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτυφία</span>
			: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέθῠφα</span> dub. cj.in <i><span class="en">
				Crobyl.
				4
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέθαιφε</span> cod.A <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.42.3
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπο-</span>): —
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				362a7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				141
			</span></i>, etc.: fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῠφήσομαι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				505
			</span></i>: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτύφην </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				221
			</span></i>: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέθυμμαι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				230a
			</span></i>:—<i>raise a smoke,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				37.36
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύφειν
			καπνόν</span> Hdt.l.c.: abs., <i>smoke,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ σποδῷ μυδῶσα κηκὶς μηρίων
					ἐτήκετο κἄτυφε κἀνέπτυε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1009
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>smoke,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῦφε πολλῷ τῷ καπνῷ</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς σφῆκας</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				457
			</span></i> (troch.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				1079
			</span></i> (troch.):—
				Pass.
			, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλισσαι] καπνῷ τυφόμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.134
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυφόμεθα</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ούμεθα</span>
			)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ὑπὸ τοῦ καπνοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					310d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>consume in smoke, burn slowly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυφέτω, καιέτω τὸν Αἴτνας μηλονόμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					659
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. τὸν χόρτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.29
				</span></i>
			 (as 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυροῦσι</span>
			): metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Crobyl.
			</span></i> l.c.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>smoke, smoulder,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύφεται Ἴλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					145
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθὼν] καπνῷ κατερείπεται τυφομένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					478
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυφέσθω Κύκλωψ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					655
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνον τυφόμενον</span>
			<i>smouldering</i> flax, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				12.20
			</span></i> ( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. καπνιζόμενον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				42.3
			</span></i>): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυφόμενος πόλεμος</span>
			<i>smouldering,</i> but not yet broken out, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; also of the fire of love, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθοις τυφόμενον γλυκὺ πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.63
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				92
			</span></i> (Id.), <i><span class="en">
				5.123
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				130
			</span></i> (Id.), <i><span class="en">
				11.41
			</span></i> (Id.).</div>
